{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026dDPpHyG0dF1795076789.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>亞太區股市個別發展。</p><p></p><p>日本股市連升兩日。韓國股市走勢反覆，指數一度失守5,000點關口，收市反彈至5,100點以上。受美國科技股拖累，台灣股市失守4萬點關口，收市跌逾百分之4。澳洲股市在礦業股拖累，連跌第六日。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T09:35:02.703214+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":105,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T08:16:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T00:57:13.354501+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T09:28:25.120276+00:00","content_hash":"de7811077d6c6fa1f5c9aff5f330050991391fa23fcd38fbc99acecd9e01715c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T09:35:02.703214+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}